  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "GizmosBoxBehaviour manages the rendering and interactive manipulation of scene entity gizmos (translation, rotation, scaling) within the editor viewport. It utilizes raycasting and a picking texture to determine user interaction with specific gizmo handles. The component handles complex geometric transformations, updating the entity's Transform component directly upon user drag events, while subscribing to editor state changes like GizmoMode and TransformSpace."
  },
